@startuml
[*] as InitialState
note right: New users start here
Unregistered as UnregisteredState
Access Denied as AccessDeniedState
Registered as RegisteredState
Signed In as SignedInState
Session Active as SessionActiveState
Session Finished as SessionFinishedState
Payment Processing as PaymentProcessingState
Service Completed as ServiceCompletedState

User registration attempt ->> UnregisteredState: Attempt to register
UnregisteredState ->* RegisteredState: Successful registration
UnregisteredState ->* AccessDeniedState: Failed registration

RegisteredState ->> SignedInState: Sign in
SignedInState ->* SessionActiveState: Access available facilities
SessionActiveState ->* SessionFinishedState: Finish session
SessionActiveState ->* PaymentProcessingState: Payment processing for finance-related services
PaymentProcessingState ->* ServiceCompletedState: Insurance-based payment completion

note right: User can read news and expert content in any state
note right: User can check symptoms or fitness options in any state
note right: User can view result (symptoms or fitness check) in any state

SessionActiveState ->> PaymentProcessingState: Payment processing for finance-related services
PaymentProcessingState ->* ServiceCompletedState: Insurance-based payment completion

note right: System logs out users at the end of their session
SessionFinishedState ->> AccessDeniedState: Log out user

finalstate SessionFinishedState
finalstate ServiceCompletedState

@enduml
